Subject: [PATCH] Repair the test source sets the merges still leave broken

0010's RustMatrixClientFactoryTest hunk is already in the tree. This keeps
the duplicated share-intent helpers, the duplicated mimeType parameter, and
the two onSendMessage call sites that still use the renamed API, and drops
the second copy of the five message-search presenter tests the merge left
after OpenPushRules.

